**Key DSL patterns used:**

| Pattern | Explanation |
|---|---|
| `"path": "s.vehicleId.vehicleId"` | Navigates the FK reference from `shipments.vehicleId` → `vehicles.vehicleId` |
| `"@type": "subquery"` | Embeds a scalar correlated subquery in the SELECT clause |
| `"@type": "outerRef", "depth": 1` | References the parent query's columns (`s.vehicleId.vehicleId` and `s.date`) from within the subquery |
| `"operator": "LESS_THAN"` on dates | Ensures only maintenance events **before** the shipment date are considered |
| `"operator": "SUBTRACT"` on dates | Computes the integer day difference between two date values |
| `NULL` propagation | When no prior maintenance row exists, `MAX()` returns NULL; SUBTRACT with NULL → NULL (no prior maintenance case handled automatically) |
